Z||000000||Kevin-84SE||09-15-2001||11:50 PM||||I hope this is not a repeat of known information but while digging through some of my old Fiero newsletters from 1985 I found the following information regarding 1984:<P>Item/Option    Number made   % of production<BR>Sunroof        66,485           49.4%<BR>automatic      57,737           42.9%<BR>4-speed        76,848           57.1%<BR>tilt column   117,224           87.1%<BR>AM Radio        3,903            2.9%<BR>AM/FM Stereo   42,933           31.9%<BR>"" W/Cassette  86,269           64.1%<BR>Tinted glass  126,375           93.9%<BR>Power Windows  60.159           44.7%<BR>rear defroster 56,929           42.8%<BR>air-cond.     106,053           78.8%<BR>digital clock 125,837           93.5%<BR>cruse control  53.296**         39.6%**<P>** note: two figures were published for this with only 1/10th % difference<P>Total production for 1984 134,585<P>   Kevin||||reg||1
